    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Spearpoint Task Force",
    "summary": "Once per battle, the Assault Doctrine or the Tactical Doctrine may be chosen one extra time. ADEPTUS ASTARTES MOUNTED/SPEEDER units of yours get +1 to Advance rolls. SUBODEN KHAN units of yours gain Wrath of the First Khan: as each Fight phase ends, if that unit had been eligible to fight in that phase, you may use the ability; an unengaged unit can then make a Normal move, and an engaged one may instead make a Fall-back move. Your army can contain WHITE SCARS units, but no ADEPTUS ASTARTES units belonging to another Chapter.",
